What does the following C code print?

int a = 10, b = 4;
printf("%d %d", a / b, a % b);

What does the following C code print?

#define SQUARE(x) x * x
printf("%d", SQUARE(2 + 3));

What does the following C++ code print?

int f(int a, int b = 5) { return a + b; }
int main() { cout << f(3) << f(3, 4); return 0; }

What happens when the following Java code is compiled?

final int x = 5;
x = 6;

What does the following Java code print?

String s = "abc";
System.out.println(s.length() + s.charAt(1));

